{
  "id": "encounter_01_inheritance",
  "title": "仙缘传承 — 上古修士遗泽",
  "description": "在山林间发现破败石碑，碑上刻着模糊符文，靠近时石碑发出微弱光芒",
  "type": "inheritance",
  "probability": 0.08,
  "trigger_conditions": {
    "region": "zhongyuan",
    "min_realm": "qi_refining_early",
    "cooldown_minutes": 5
  },
  "dao_heart_alignment": "neutral",
  "start_node": "INHERITANCE_START",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "INHERITANCE_START",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你在山林间发现一座破败的石碑，碑上刻着模糊的符文。\n当你靠近时，石碑突然发出微弱的光芒，一段信息传入你的脑海...",
      "next_node": "INHERITANCE_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "INHERITANCE_CHOICE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "石碑上的符文似乎在诉说着什么，你需要做出选择。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "accept",
          "text": "静心感悟，尝试接受这段传承",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "item_give", "target": "ancient_martial_art_fragment", "value": 1},
            {"type": "dao_heart_change", "value": 5}
          ],
          "next_node": "INHERITANCE_ACCEPT"
        },
        {
          "id": "observe",
          "text": "先观察是否有陷阱或阵法",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "skill_check", "target": "perception", "operator": ">=", "value": 10}
          ],
          "next_node": "INHERITANCE_OBSERVE_CHECK"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "拓印碑文，回去研究",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "item_give", "target": "rune_rubbing_fragment", "value": 1},
            {"type": "quest_trigger", "target": "find_full_inheritance", "value": true}
          ],
          "next_node": "INHERITANCE_LEAVE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "INHERITANCE_ACCEPT",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你盘膝坐下，静心感悟石碑上传来的信息。\n\n一股温暖的灵力涌入你的体内，一段残缺的功法在脑海中闪现...\n\n[b]获得：[/b]上古功法残篇（黄阶）\n[b]道心：[/b]+5",
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "INHERITANCE_OBSERVE_CHECK",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你运转灵气感知，仔细观察石碑周围的阵法痕迹。",
      "next_node": "INHERITANCE_OBSERVE_RESULT"
    },
    {
      "id": "INHERITANCE_OBSERVE_RESULT",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "[b]感知成功：[/b]你发现石碑后方隐藏着一处小型洞府的入口线索。\n石碑只是一个引子，真正的传承在洞府深处。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]洞府位置线索",
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "INHERITANCE_LEAVE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你小心翼翼地拓印了碑文，将符文碎片收入怀中。\n\n这块石碑绝不简单，回去找云中鹤前辈研究一下。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]符文拓片\n[b]解锁任务：[/b]寻找完整传承",
      "next_node": "END"
    }
  ]
}
